    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG - Castleknock are delighted to present to the market no. 34 Annagh Court to the market. This is a BLANK CANVAS three bedroom, duplex home with a private west facing rear balcony, ideally located in this quiet cul-de-sac in the prestigious Waterville development. This property is well maintained throughout and is in walk in condition.\n\nAccommodation comprises of entrance hallway, living Room, kitchen / breakfast room, guest WC, three generous double bedrooms (master en-suite) and a family bathroom. \n\nThe features continue outside with a glorious west-facing rear balcony that is not overlooked. To the front there is ample residents' parking.\n\nWaterville is well serviced by excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre - Dublin Airport, N3 and M50 are all easily accessible. Local primary and secondary schools, Blanchardstown Village and Shopping Centre are all within walking distance. National Aquatic Centre and Ballycoolin Business Park are within a short drive. \n\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith alarm point and under stair storage.\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.14m x 0.98m\nWc, whb and extractor.\n\nLiving Room - 6.56m x 4.30m\nLarge living room that has a feature fireplace, tv point and a large bay window.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.58m x 4.44m\nBright room with fitted wall and base units, integrated gas hob/oven and double door access to spacious west facing balcony. You also have a small utility room located off the kitchen that is plumbed for was\n\nBalcony - 5.27m x 2.57m\nLarge west facing private balcony.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.06m x 3.92m\nDouble room with laminate flooring and a walk in wardrobe.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.22m x 2.14m\nWc, whb, shower and window for natural ventilation.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.10m x 2.95m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.38m x 2.55m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Well maintained and modern three bed duplex bedroom apartment c. 119 SQM / 1,280 sq ft</li><li> Excellent first time buyer or investment opportunity</li><li> Three double bedrooms</li><li> Built c.2007</li><li> Landscaped communal areas</li><li> Excellent and convenient location</li><li> Walking distance to amenities</li><li> Management Company - Paramount Estates</li><li> Management fee - 1,133 per annum</ul>"
      },
